285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (PriceBeo is a Dublin-based mobile app that lets Irish shoppers scan a grocery barcode and get  real-time price comparisons across Tesco, Dunnes Stores, SuperValu, Lidl, and Aldi in under two seconds. Grocery prices in Ireland have risen 27% since 2021, yet no practical tool exists for consumers to compare prices at the point of purchase. Our primary research directly confirmed this gap. 96% of respondents identified price as their main grocery factor, 76% regularly overspend due to price uncertainty, and 89% said they would download PriceBeo. This is not a future opportunity. It is a problem happening in every supermarket in Ireland every week.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
