/P 202 0 R
/E (Five co-founders lead the business, each holding a 20% equity stake, covering CEO, COO, CFO, CTO, and CMO functions. The COO's placement at Aldi provided direct exposure to the problem PriceBeo solves. The CTO has validated the technical architecture. A software engineering advisor, a corporate law solicitor, and a retail industry expert support the team.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
289 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (PriceBeo does not ask consumers to change their shopping habits. It removes the friction that stops them from acting on a decision they are already trying to make.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
