/P 204 0 R
/E (PriceBeo operates with a flat, co-founder-led structure consistent with best practice for a capital-efficient software startup at the pre-Series A stage. Each co-founder holds an equal 20% equity stake and carries executive responsibility for a defined functional area. All five founders sit on the board of directors and operate by consensus on all material decisions. There are no management layers between the board and individual contributors at this stage.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
