/T (Email Marketing: PriceBeo will utilise email marketing to maintain engagement with users. Users will receive daily and weekly emails including reports of the super savings that they have made by using PriceBeo. Users that do not use PriceBeo frequently will receive emails showing them the deals that they are missing out on by not using PriceBeo. More seasonal emails will also be sent out during busy retail periods including New Year, Easter, Christmas, Halloween and Summer.   )
