/T (One such virtual influencer is Lil Miquela who has 3.3 million followers on TikTok and 2.3 million on Instagram. All of this content is completely AI-generated, and no real humans feature on any post. This highlights the marketing potential that virtual influencers can have. PriceBeo will use this modern and cheap strategy to appeal to its target audience. This will appeal most to the tech-savvy consumers between 18-30. PriceBeo will also create their own virtual influencer known as PriceBeo Paddy. )
