<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 223 0 R
/E (Moving away from web scraping and towards formal API partnerships with all five major retailers. Under this model, supermarkets provide structured data feeds with barcodes, product names and prices directly from their trading departments. Quidu already operates this way in Ireland with over 40,000 products, and Trolley.co.uk does the same in the UK. Compared to scraping, this gives us cleaner data, real-time hourly updates and proper commercial relationships with each retailer.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
