<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (PriceBeo does not require a patent. The platform is built on existing open-source technologies such as React Native, PostgreSQL and Google ML Kit, rather than a novel invention, so patent protection does not apply. Instead, the business will operate as a Private Limited Company and rely on retailer partnership agreements to secure exclusive data access, protect commercial relationships and create a defensible competitive moat. This aligns with CCPC \(2025\) guidance on transparency and fair market practices in the Irish grocery sector.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
